/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/016.md:8:## 1. 穿墙步数色板染色
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/016.md:9:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/016.md:10:- 参考题目题号：9（3bd292e8）、18（9356391f）
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/016.md:11:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/016.md:12:  - operation:重涂色, recolor
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/016.md:13:  - operation:洪泛填充, flood_fill
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/016.md:14:  - object:分隔墙线, separator_wall
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/016.md:15:  - object:色板行, palette_row
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/016.md:16:  - object:分隔行, separator_row
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/016.md:17:  - object:种子像素, seed_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/016.md:18:  - relation:区域邻接图, region_adjacency_graph
