/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/032.md:117:## 4. 动量传递链
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/032.md:118:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/032.md:119:- 参考题目题号：19 (d687bc17)、4 (3906de3d)、20 (5521c0d9)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/032.md:120:- 难度评审：达标
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/032.md:121:- tags:
