/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/032.md:123:  - object:边框, frame
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/032.md:124:  - object:实心矩形, solid_rectangle
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/032.md:125:  - object:推动标记, pusher_marker
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/032.md:126:  - relation:颜色匹配边, color_matches_side
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/032.md:127:  - relation:跨度相交传动, span_overlap_transmission
