/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:8:## 1. 错相补丁——壁纸里的完美伪装
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:9:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:10:- 参考题目题号: 14, 1, 5
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:11:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:12:  - operation:周期检测, periodic_detection
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:13:  - operation:异常提取, anomaly_extraction
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:14:  - operation:裁剪, crop
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:15:  - object:周期瓦片, periodic_tile
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:16:  - object:错相印章, phase_shifted_stamp
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:17:  - relation:残差类多数决, residue_majority_vote
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:18:  - condition:相位矛盾定位, phase_violation_locates
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:19:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:20:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:21:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:22:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:23:一句话总述：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:24:一块用同一壁纸错开相位印上去的补丁潜伏在周期壁纸里，找到它并裁剪输出。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:25:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:26:输入结构：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:27:- 整个网格铺满一张多色周期壁纸，不含黑色；行周期与列周期都不超过网格尺寸的三分之一。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:28:- 一块4连通的补丁被印在壁纸上，印的内容是同一张壁纸平移了一个非周期整数倍向量后的图案：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:29:  补丁内部自身完全满足同样的周期纹理，任何局部检查都毫无破绽，只有相位与全局对不上。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:30:- 补丁内每个格子的错相颜色都与该位置的正相标准色不同；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:31:  每个周期残差类中被补丁覆盖的格子数严格少于该类总数的一半。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:32:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:33:规则：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:34:- 用全网格多数决恢复每个残差类的正相标准色。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:35:- 与正相标准色不一致的格子即补丁格子；它们恰好构成一个4连通块。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:36:- 以补丁的包围盒裁剪输出：补丁格子保留错相颜色，包围盒内其余格子输出黑色。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:37:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:38:关键洞察：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:39:- 补丁不是异色、不是噪声、局部纹理也完全正确，它与壁纸的唯一差别是一个整体相位差；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:40:  只有先确立全局周期坐标系，才能让这块"完美伪装"显形，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:41:  输出的锯齿轮廓正是两套相位的分界线。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:42:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:43:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:44:## 2. 严丝合缝——按嵌合顺序落下的拼块
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:45:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:46:- 参考题目题号: 10, 5, 20
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:47:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:48:  - operation:重力下落, gravity_drop
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:49:  - operation:形状匹配, shape_matching
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:50:  - object:地形轮廓, terrain_contour
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:51:  - object:多联骨牌, polyomino_piece
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:52:  - relation:轮廓互补, contour_complement
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:53:  - condition:零缝隙落位, zero_gap_landing
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:54:  - condition:唯一可落顺序, unique_order_chain
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:55:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:56:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:57:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:58:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:59:一句话总述：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:60:把悬浮的彩色拼块逐一垂直落进灰色地形，每块只能落在使其下方不留任何空腔的水平位置，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:61:落定后成为新地形。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:62:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:63:输入结构：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:64:- 网格下部是与底边相连的灰色地形，轮廓无悬垂（每列灰色自底边连续向上），
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:65:  带有大小形状各异的凹口。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:66:- 网格上部悬浮若干互不相同的彩色多联骨牌拼块，彼此不相邻。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:67:- 任意时刻恰有一枚尚未落下的拼块存在唯一的零缝隙落位，其余拼块暂时无处可嵌。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:68:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:69:规则：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:70:- 拼块可整体水平平移到任意列位置后竖直下落，直到与地形（含已落定拼块）接触。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:71:- 合法落位要求：静止后拼块下方、其所占各列内不存在被拼块与地形夹住的黑色空腔。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:72:- 每次只落当下唯一有合法落位的那一块；落定后它并入地形，再选下一块，直至全部落完。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:73:- 输出中所有拼块保持自身颜色嵌在地形里，上空只剩黑色背景。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:74:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:75:关键洞察：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:76:- 落点与拼块初始所在列无关，由轮廓互补关系挑选；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:77:  先落的块改变地形，才为后落的块开出唯一缺口，顺序是被嵌合条件锁死的连锁。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:78:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:79:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:80:## 3. 颜料罐按边框用量认主
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:81:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:82:- 参考题目题号: 9, 13, 15
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:83:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:84:  - operation:重涂色, recolor
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:85:  - operation:计数, counting
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:86:  - operation:擦除, erase
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:87:  - object:空心环, hollow_ring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:88:  - object:颜料罐色块, paint_can_block
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:89:  - relation:数量守恒配对, quantity_conservation_pairing
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:90:  - condition:块面积等于边框格数, block_area_equals_border_count
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:91:  - condition:洞容量为诱饵, hole_capacity_decoy
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:92:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:93:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:94:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:95:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:96:一句话总述：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:97:每个实心色块是一罐定量颜料，恰好够重刷某一个空心环的整圈边框，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:98:找到用量吻合的环刷上去，用完的颜料罐从画面上消失。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:99:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:100:输入结构：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:101:- 黑色背景上有两类对象：若干闭合空心环（各自单色、外形不规则、内洞不触边）
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:102:  和若干实心色块（颜料罐），两类对象颜色互不重复。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:103:- 每个实心块的格子数恰好等于某一个环的边框格子数，且这种对应一一配齐。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:104:- 布置了强诱饵：部分实心块的格子数同时恰好等于某个错误环的内洞容量；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:105:  只看第一个示例时"块面积=洞容量、把洞填上"的解释完全成立，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:106:  但后续示例会推翻它——洞在正确答案里始终保持黑色。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:107:- 邻近关系、外形相似性与颜色之间也不存在任何可用的对应。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:108:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:109:规则：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:110:- 数出每个实心块的格子数和每个环的边框格子数。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:111:- 块面积与环边框格数相等者互相绑定。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:112:- 把每个环的整圈边框重涂成所绑定块的颜色，内洞保持黑色，同时抹去该实心块。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:113:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:114:关键洞察：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:115:- 守恒的是颜料的用量而不是容器的容积："面积=洞容量"是精心铺设的第一直觉陷阱，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:116:  只有发现颜料恰够漆完一圈边框这层数量守恒，全部示例才能同时成立；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:117:  用过的颜料罐不留痕迹。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:118:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:119:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:120:## 4. 从未画出的对角线与压线权
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:121:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:122:- 参考题目题号: 18, 17, 4
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:123:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:124:  - operation:连线, line_drawing
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:125:  - operation:交点提取, intersection_extraction
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:126:  - object:边框标记, border_marker
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:127:  - object:隐形对角线, invisible_diagonal
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:128:  - relation:同色配对, same_color_pairing
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:129:  - condition:仅交点显形, only_crossings_materialize
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:130:  - condition:主对角压反对角, main_diagonal_priority
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:131:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:132:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:133:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:134:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:135:一句话总述：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:136:边框上同色成对的标记各自确定一条45度隐形对角线段，只在两线相交的格子落下一个点，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:137:点的颜色取主对角方向那条线的颜色，线段本身一概不画。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:138:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:139:输入结构：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:140:- 黑色网格，彩色标记像素全部位于最外圈边框上。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:141:- 每种颜色恰好出现两次，同色两点的行差绝对值等于列差绝对值，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:142:  可由一条45度对角线段连接。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:143:- 线段分主对角方向（左上-右下走向）与反对角方向（左下-右上走向）两族，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:144:  同族线段互不相交。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:145:- 任意主对角线段与反对角线段要么恰好共享一个格子，要么完全不相交。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:146:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:147:规则：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:148:- 为每对同色标记构造连接它们的对角线段，但不落笔。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:149:- 每逢一条主对角线段与一条反对角线段共享一个格子，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:150:  就把该格涂成主对角那条线段的颜色。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:151:- 其余所有格子输出黑色，边框标记也一并抹去。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:152:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:153:关键洞察：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:154:- 参与规则的线段在画面上从未出现，输出只是零散的彩色孤点；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:155:  必须先在脑中复原整束隐形对角线才能定位交点，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:156:  还要再发现"主对角方向压过反对角方向"这一层，才能解释每个孤点为何是那个颜色。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:157:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:158:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:159:## 5. 双源管线——跳数既选色又定角
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:160:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:161:- 参考题目题号: 12, 7, 11
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:162:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:163:  - operation:传输, transmit
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:164:  - operation:旋转, rotate
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/022.md:165:  - object:管线网络, wire_network
