/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/031.md:114:  - object:多色精灵体, multicolor_sprite
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/031.md:115:  - object:嵌入标记像素, embedded_marker
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/031.md:116:  - object:孤立控制点, isolated_control
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/031.md:117:  - relation:颜色配对, color_pairing
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/031.md:118:  - relation:连锁反应, chain_reaction
