/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/031.md:183:  - operation:对称补全, symmetry_completion
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/031.md:184:  - operation:平移匹配, translation_matching
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/031.md:185:  - object:色彩面板, color_panel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/031.md:186:  - object:分隔列, separator_column
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/031.md:187:  - relation:前后遮挡, front_back_occlusion
