/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:95:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:96:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:97:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:98:边缘光源发出的光线依次被粉色方块横向错位反射、被灰色方块吸收,输出每条光线的终点。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:99:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:100:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:101:- 黑背景上散布若干实心正方形块:粉色为反射镜,灰色为吸收体,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:102:  边长均为奇数且可以不同,摆放位置高低不一;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:103:- 网格边缘有一个或多个栗色光源像素。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:104:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:105:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:106:- 每个光源沿其所在行(源位于左右边缘)或所在列(源位于上下边缘)直线传播;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:107:- 传播途中依次结算与路径相交的方块:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:108:  - 经过粉色方块后,光线的行号(或列号)关于该方块的中心行(列)做镜像,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:109:    随后从方块另一侧继续同向传播;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:110:  - 撞上灰色方块则终止,在被撞面外侧紧邻的背景格染栗色;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:111:- 路径若不再与任何方块相交,则在对侧边缘格染栗色;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:112:- 方块与光线路径不相交时对光线没有任何影响;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:113:- 输出=输入网格加上每条光线的终点栗色像素,光源保留。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:114:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:115:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:116:- 方块不是目标物而是光学元件;每次关于不同中心的镜像都会改变后续
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:117:  会命中哪些方块,必须按顺序追踪整条因果链;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:118:- 关于不同中心的反射不满足交换律,复合结果不可约化为简单的奇偶计数。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:119:```
