/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:135:每个主体对象按四个方向上"力点"像素的计数差构成的二维向量整体平移。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:136:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:137:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:138:- 背景色占多数;若干单色多格主体对象,形状颜色各异;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:139:- 大量统一颜色的单像素力点,每个力点恰好落在某一个主体的行带或列带内
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:140:  (即与该主体的 bbox 同行区间或同列区间)。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:141:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:142:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:143:- 对每个主体统计:L=行带内位于其左侧的力点数,R=右侧;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:144:  U=列带内位于其上方的力点数,D=下方;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:145:- 主体水平平移 R-L 格(正向右),垂直平移 D-U 格(正向下),
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:146:  两个方向同时结算;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:147:- 输出中所有力点消失,主体形状与颜色不变,原位置变为背景。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:148:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:149:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:150:- 力点不是要连线、包围或吸附的目标;单看一个示例像"移动到最近的点旁",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:151:  这一读法在其余示例上会失败;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:152:- 每侧的个数之差构成一个位移向量,方向与距离全部来自计数差。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:153:```
