/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:167:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:168:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:169:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:170:以单色面板为单元掩码、多色面板为结构,做逐格重染的克罗内克展开,同色格触发图底反转。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:171:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:172:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:173:- 一条灰色分隔线把网格分成两个面板;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:174:- 一个面板含多种非背景颜色(结构面板),另一个只含单一颜色 c(单元掩码);
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:175:- 两个面板的相对位置(左右/上下、谁先谁后)在不同示例中不固定。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:176:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:177:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:178:- 输出的行列数 = 结构面板尺寸 × 掩码面板尺寸;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:179:- 结构面板的每个格对应输出中一个掩码大小的块:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:180:  - 非背景格且颜色 v≠c:该块 = 掩码形状染成 v,掩码背景处留背景;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:181:  - 非背景格且颜色恰为 c:该块改用掩码的反相
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:182:    (掩码为背景处染 c,掩码本体处留背景);
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:183:  - 背景格:对应全背景块。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:184:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:185:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:186:- 两个面板的角色不由位置决定,而由是否单色决定;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:187:- 与掩码同色的格触发图底反转,这一分支只有对比多个示例才会显形,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:188:  单看首例会以为是纯粹的重染展开。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:189:```
