/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:237:  - object:标尺条, ruler_bar
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:238:  - object:附着像素, attached_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:239:  - relation:行列周期, periodicity
