/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:241:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:242:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:243:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:244:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:245:远处每条灰色标尺条以自身的长度、位置、朝向和附着色遥控格栅图案的一次周期性重染。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:246:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:247:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:248:- 网格一侧是一块多行的格栅图案(背景与单一前景色的交替纹样);
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:249:- 图案之外的空白处有一条或多条灰色直条,每条一端附着一个彩色像素。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:250:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:251:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:252:- 每条灰条独立结算一次重染:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:253:  - 水平灰条作用于列:周期 = 条长,相位 = 附着像素所在列,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:254:    选中与该列模周期同余的所有列;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:255:  - 竖直灰条作用于行:周期 = 条长,相位 = 附着像素所在行;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:256:- 把格栅图案内被选中列(行)上的前景像素重染为该条附着像素的颜色,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:257:  背景格与其余前景保持不变;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:258:- 输出与输入同尺寸,灰条及其附着像素抹为背景。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:259:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:260:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:261:- 周期、相位、作用轴、新颜色四个参数全部由远处的标尺条编码:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:262:  长度=周期,位置=相位,朝向=轴,附着色=新色;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:263:- 格栅内部不含任何这些信息;首例容易误判为"固定每隔三列重染",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:264:  该读法在其余示例上失效。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:265:```
