/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/017.md:161:  - operation:遮挡修复, occlusion_repair
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/017.md:162:  - object:本体对象, source_object
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/017.md:163:  - object:影子对象, sheared_twin
