/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:215:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:216:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:217:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:218:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:219:以中缝为镜轴配对左右两板上的残缺对象,互相补全缺失像素并用对侧板色作补丁,清除无伙伴的幻影。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:220:
