/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/026.md:8:## 1. 连锁泊车
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/026.md:9:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/026.md:10:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/026.md:11:  - operation:滑动, slide
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/026.md:12:  - operation:擦除, erase
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/026.md:13:  - object:矩形体, rectangular_body
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/026.md:14:  - object:连接杆, connector_stem
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/026.md:15:  - object:锚定物, anchor_object
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/026.md:16:  - relation:碰撞阻挡, collision_blocking
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/026.md:17:  - relation:顺序涌现堆叠, order_dependent_stacking
