/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:8:## 1. 隐形正方形的重叠
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:9:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:10:- 参考题目题号: 12, 13
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:11:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:12:  - operation:重建, reconstruction
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:13:  - operation:填充, fill
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:14:  - object:三角标记组, three_corner_markers
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:15:  - object:隐形正方形, invisible_square
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:16:  - relation:缺角定位, missing_corner_pos
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:17:  - relation:区域重叠, region_overlap
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:18:  - condition:覆盖层数决定颜色, overlap_count_colors
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:19:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:20:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:21:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:22:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:23:由三角标记重建从未画出的实心正方形，按覆盖层数上色，双重覆盖处涂红。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:24:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:25:输入结构：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:26:- 背景为黑色。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:27:- 若干种非红颜色各以恰好三个孤立单像素出现，每组三点是某个正方形的三个
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:28:  顶点，第四个顶点缺失。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:29:- 不同组对应的正方形边长不同，位置相互交错。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:30:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:31:规则：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:32:- 对每组同色三点，补出缺失的第四顶点，得到该组对应的完整实心正方形区域
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:33:  （含边界）。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:34:- 这些正方形不直接画出；逐格统计每个格子被多少个重建正方形覆盖。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:35:- 恰被一个正方形覆盖的格子涂该正方形的颜色；被两个正方形同时覆盖的格子
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:36:  涂红色；未被覆盖的格子保持黑色。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:37:- 输出尺寸与输入相同。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:38:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:39:关键洞察：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:40:- 画面上从未出现任何正方形，只有它们的生成元（三个角）；答案取决于把每
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:41:  个缺角方向判对之后，隐形区域之间的交叠关系，而交叠区域往往落在没有任
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:42:  何标记的空白处。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:43:```
