/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:116:- 参考题目题号: 3
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:117:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:118:  - operation:因果反演, causal_inversion
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:119:  - object:攀升路径, climbing_path
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/001.md:120:  - object:障碍块, blocker
