/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:214:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:215:- 参考题目: `baf41dbf`(4), `f9012d9b`(10)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:216:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:217:  - operation:补全, completion
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:218:  - operation:平铺延拓, tiling_extension
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:219:  - object:平移对称图案, translational_pattern
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:220:  - object:控制像素, control_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:221:  - object:污染格, corrupted_cell
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:222:  - relation:先修复后延拓, repair_then_extend
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:223:  - relation:控制点定延拓界, control_bounds_extension
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:224:  - condition:保持相位截断, phase_preserving_cut
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:225:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:226:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:227:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:228:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:229:先用周期多数投票修复图案里的污染格，再把修复后的周期图案延拓铺满控制像素框定的目标矩形。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:230:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:231:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:232:- 背景为主导色；一个具有水平与竖直平移周期的彩色图案占据一个小矩形，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:233:  其中少量格子被统一的污染色覆盖。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:234:- 另一颜色的孤立控制像素各自位于目标矩形四边的外侧一格处。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:235:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:236:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:237:- 对图案内每个污染格，取其平移周期轨道上未污染格的一致颜色予以恢复。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:238:- 以修复后的图案为锚、按原周期向四周平铺，铺满控制像素框定的目标矩形，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:239:  边界处按格截断（目标尺寸不必是周期的整数倍）。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:240:- 控制像素原样保留。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:241:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:242:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:243:- 诱饵有两层——直接平铺会把污染扩散出去，而把延拓当成拉伸会破坏相位；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:244:  正确做法是先靠周期自证清白地修复，再保持相位地延拓截断。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:245:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/049.md:246:
