/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/029.md:8:## 1. 双滑块对撞
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/029.md:9:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/029.md:10:- 参考题目题号: 1 (332f06d7)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/029.md:11:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/029.md:12:  - operation:滑动, slide
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/029.md:13:  - operation:路径搜索, pathfinding
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/029.md:14:  - object:实心方块, solid_square
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/029.md:15:  - object:蜿蜒通道, winding_channel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/029.md:16:  - object:窄口, chokepoint
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/029.md:17:  - relation:尺寸约束通行, size_constrains_passage
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/029.md:18:  - relation:双动体互撞, mutual_collision
