/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/018.md:6:## 1. 弹射入槽
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/018.md:7:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/018.md:8:- 参考题目: a3df8b1e, d9f24cd1, db7260a4
