/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:8:## 1. 缺角矩形的层序复原
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:9:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:10:- 参考题目: `4290ef0e`, `b6afb2da`, `8a6d367c`
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:11:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:12:  - operation:补全, complete
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:13:  - operation:填充, fill
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:14:  - object:角点生成元, corner_generator
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:15:  - object:实心矩形, solid_rectangle
