/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:85:## 3. 带假指针的色标链
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:86:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:87:- 参考题目: `668eec9a`, `891232d6`, `505fff84`
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:88:- tags:
