/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:242:## 7. 滤色的边界影子
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:243:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:244:- 参考题目: `6f8cd79b`, `891232d6`, `8e301a54`
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:245:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:246:  - operation:描边, border_draw
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:247:  - operation:擦除, erase
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:248:  - object:画布边界, canvas_boundary
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:249:  - object:单色对象, monochrome_object
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:250:  - relation:投射, projection
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:251:  - relation:遮挡改色, occluder_recolors_shadow
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:252:  - condition:最近边归属, nearest_edge_assignment
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:253:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:254:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:255:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:256:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:257:每个对象向其最近的画布边投下影子，被中间物遮挡的影段改涂遮挡者的颜色，输出只保留边框。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:258:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:259:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:260:- 背景网格内散布若干互不同色的单色实心矩形，均不接触画布边缘。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:261:- 每个对象到四条边的最小距离唯一，不存在并列；所有影段不触及
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:262:  边框四角。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:263:- 某些对象与其最近边之间部分或全部隔着另一个对象。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:264:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:265:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:266:- 输出与输入同尺寸：内部全部清为背景，四条边画一圈默认灰色边框。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:267:- 每个对象向其最近边投影，影段范围等于对象在该边方向上的跨度。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:268:- 影段中被其他对象隔挡的列（或行）涂遮挡者的颜色，未被隔挡的部分
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:269:  涂对象自身颜色；多层隔挡时取最靠近该边的遮挡者。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:270:- 对象只在自己的最近边方向产生影子；即使它在某行或某列上是从别的
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:271:  边看进来的第一个物体，只要那条边不是它的最近边，它就不自行投影，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:272:  但仍会为别人的影子改色。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:273:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:274:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:275:- 边框不是“四面环视看见谁涂谁”：影子的存在由最近边归属决定，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:276:  影子的颜色再被路径上的遮挡者逐段改写，两层规则缺一不可。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:277:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:278:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:279:## 8. 双缝光锥
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:280:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:281:- 参考题目: `bae5c565`, `891232d6`, `e3721c99`
