/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:285:  - object:挡光条, wall_row
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:286:  - object:障碍像素, obstacle_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:287:  - object:颜色图例, color_legend
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:288:  - relation:锥形扩散, cone_spread
