/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:51:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:52:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:53:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:54:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:55:把每块瓦片的孔洞读作指向另一瓦片的坐标指针，沿指针链走到尽头，用终点
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:56:瓦片的颜色重涂整块并填实孔洞。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:57:
