/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/003.md:199:## 6. 多数决的逐波连锁染色
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/003.md:200:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/003.md:201:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/003.md:202:  - operation:重涂色, recolor
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/003.md:203:  - operation:连锁传播, chain_propagation
