/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/042.md:274:## 8. 块坐标周期
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/042.md:275:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/042.md:276:- 参考题目：7d419a02、f823c43c、0b148d64
