/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/007.md:238:  - relation:等差步距, arithmetic_spacing
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/007.md:239:  - relation:逐步旋转, stepwise_rotation
